Fire a poisoned dart from a silent, concealed launcher on your person that deals [67, 82, 94, 104, 112 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] physical damage and puts the target (living only) to sleep for 4 turns, rendering them unable to act. Every [76, 94, 108, 119, 129 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] points of damage the target takes brings it closer to waking by 1 turn.

This can be used without breaking stealth.

Prepared with: not prepared
